SUMMARY:🎶 Music Bingo at Ponysaurus 🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nCome hang with us for a fun\, low-pr
 essure night out at Ponysaurus Brewing for Music Bingo — good drinks\, g
 ood people\, and just enough friendly competition to keep things interesti
 ng.\n\nAnd yes\, there are usually multiple chances to win\, so feel free 
 to jump in even if you show up a little later. Dog friendly and food also!
 \n\nPonysaurus is one of the best casual hang spots in Durham\, so even if
  bingo isn’t your life’s calling\, it’s still a great excuse to come
  out\, have a drink\, meet new people\, and enjoy the patio vibes. Think e
 asy conversation\, laid-back energy\, and a night that feels social withou
 t being forced.\n\nWhat to expect:\n🍺 Great beer and a relaxed brewery 
 vibe\n🎵 Multiple rounds of Music Bingo\n😌 Casual\, easygoing atmosph
 ere\n🗣️ Plenty of time to mingle between rounds\n🌙 A solid weeknig
 ht excuse to get out of the house\n\nCome for the bingo\, stay for the han
 gs.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31450
 2084/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T033554Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T033554Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
